#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:7
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "参考"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:10
msgid "Node contracts"
msgstr "Node 契约"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:13
msgid ""
"Definition sources, runtime registration channels, generated artifacts, and "
"validation commands for the in-repository Node API."
msgstr "仓库内 Node API 的定义来源、运行时注册通道、生成产物和验证命令。"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:17
msgid "Contract pipeline"
msgstr "契约流水线"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:19
msgid "A Node travels through four layers:"
msgstr "一个 Node 会经过四个层："

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:21
msgid ""
"A frozen `*Def` object declares its type, label, category, fields, capabilities, "
"frontend component, and optional ports."
msgstr "冻结的 `*Def` 对象声明其类型、标签、类别、字段、能力、前端组件和可选端口。"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:23
msgid ""
"A registry function records the definition and, when applicable, a runtime provider "
"such as a model builder or Observable recorder."
msgstr "注册函数记录定义，并在适用时记录运行时提供者，例如模型构建器或 Observable 记录器。"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:25
msgid "`comfy_research/nodes/generate.py` produces backend and frontend contracts."
msgstr "`comfy_research/nodes/generate.py` 生成后端和前端契约。"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:26
msgid ""
"The frontend uses generated specs to render the Node while the backend uses the "
"registered provider when the graph executes."
msgstr "前端使用生成的规范渲染 Node，图执行时后端使用已注册的提供者。"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:29
msgid ""
"Definitions under `comfy_research/nodes/definitions/` are discovered recursively. "
"Adding a module under the correct package does not require a central import list."
msgstr "会递归发现 `comfy_research/nodes/definitions/` 下的定义。在正确包下添加模块不需要维护集中导入列表。"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:33
msgid "Node channels"
msgstr "Node 通道"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Node kind"
msgstr "Node 类型"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Definition"
msgstr "定义"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Runtime registration"
msgstr "运行时注册"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Dataset"
msgstr "数据集"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "`DatasetDef` via `dataset_def(...)`"
msgstr "通过 `dataset_def(...)` 定义的 `DatasetDef`"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Optional `dataset_materializer_for(...)` and/or `dataset_preview_for(...)`"
msgstr "可选的 `dataset_materializer_for(...)` 和/或 `dataset_preview_for(...)`"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Model"
msgstr "模型"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "`ModelDef` via `model_def(...)`"
msgstr "通过 `model_def(...)` 定义的 `ModelDef`"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "`model_builder_for(...)` for runnable full models"
msgstr "用于可运行完整模型的 `model_builder_for(...)`"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Loss"
msgstr "损失"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "`LossDef` via `loss_def(...)`"
msgstr "通过 `loss_def(...)` 定义的 `LossDef`"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "`loss_criterion_for(...)` for primary criteria"
msgstr "用于主损失函数的 `loss_criterion_for(...)`"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Optimizer"
msgstr "优化器"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "`OptimizerDef` via `optimizer_def(...)`"
msgstr "通过 `optimizer_def(...)` 定义的 `OptimizerDef`"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "`optimizer_builder_for(...)`"
msgstr "`optimizer_builder_for(...)`"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Trainer"
msgstr "训练器"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "`TrainerDef` via `trainer_def(...)`"
msgstr "通过 `trainer_def(...)` 定义的 `TrainerDef`"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Uses the Trainer preparation and execution pipeline"
msgstr "使用 Trainer 准备和执行流水线"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Initialization"
msgstr "初始化"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "`InitializationDef` via `initialization_def(...)`"
msgstr "通过 `initialization_def(...)` 定义的 `InitializationDef`"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Applied by the Trainer runtime"
msgstr "由 Trainer 运行时应用"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Observable"
msgstr "Observable"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "`ObservableDef` via `observable_def(...)`"
msgstr "通过 `observable_def(...)` 定义的 `ObservableDef`"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "`recorder_for(...)` is required"
msgstr "必须使用 `recorder_for(...)`"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Frontend-only"
msgstr "仅前端"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "`FrontendNodeDef` via `frontend_node_def(...)`"
msgstr "通过 `frontend_node_def(...)` 定义的 `FrontendNodeDef`"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "No backend provider"
msgstr "没有后端提供者"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:46
msgid "Definition sources"
msgstr "定义来源"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Source"
msgstr "来源"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Responsibility"
msgstr "职责"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "`comfy_research/nodes/schema.py`"
msgstr "`comfy_research/nodes/schema.py`"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Definition dataclasses, field types, ports, frontend metadata, and Observable metadata"
msgstr "定义数据类、字段类型、端口、前端元数据和 Observable 元数据"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "`comfy_research/nodes/registry.py`"
msgstr "`comfy_research/nodes/registry.py`"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Provider decorators, discovery, uniqueness, and completeness validation"
msgstr "提供者装饰器、发现、唯一性和完整性验证"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "`comfy_research/nodes/definitions/`"
msgstr "`comfy_research/nodes/definitions/`"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid ""
"Dataset, model, loss, optimizer, trainer, initialization, Observable, and frontend "
"definitions"
msgstr "数据集、模型、损失、优化器、训练器、初始化、Observable 和前端定义"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "`comfy_research/nodes/generate.py`"
msgstr "`comfy_research/nodes/generate.py`"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:12
msgid "Deterministic backend and frontend contract generation"
msgstr "确定性的后端和前端契约生成"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:55
msgid ""
"Change a definition or generator when the contract changes. Do not edit generated "
"files to introduce behavior."
msgstr "契约变更时应修改定义或生成器。不要编辑生成文件来引入行为。"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:58
msgid "Generated outputs"
msgstr "生成输出"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:60
msgid "The generator writes these main artifacts:"
msgstr "生成器会写入以下主要产物："

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:62
msgid "`comfy_research/generated/node_manifest.json` for served node metadata;"
msgstr "`comfy_research/generated/node_manifest.json`：供服务使用的节点元数据；"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:63
msgid "`comfy_research/generated/node_kind.py` for accepted generated node kinds;"
msgstr "`comfy_research/generated/node_kind.py`：可接受的生成节点类型；"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:64
msgid "`comfy_research/generated/node_capabilities.py` for capability lookups;"
msgstr "`comfy_research/generated/node_capabilities.py`：能力查询；"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:65
msgid "`comfy_research/generated/node_params.py` for per-node parameter validation;"
msgstr "`comfy_research/generated/node_params.py`：逐节点参数验证；"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:66
msgid ""
"`frontend/src/generated/generatedNodeSpecs.ts` for frontend defaults, fields, ports, "
"categories, and sweep metadata."
msgstr "`frontend/src/generated/generatedNodeSpecs.ts`：前端默认值、字段、端口、类别和扫参元数据。"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:69
msgid ""
"The Python graph schema validates a node's `data` with the generated parameter model "
"for its type. The frontend build also checks generated metadata, so stale artifacts "
"fail before a production bundle is accepted."
msgstr "Python 图 schema 使用该类型生成的参数模型验证节点的 `data`。前端构建也会检查生成元数据，因此过期产物会在生产包被接受前失败。"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:73
msgid "Generation and validation"
msgstr "生成与验证"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:75
msgid "Generate after changing definitions:"
msgstr "修改定义后生成："

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:81
msgid "Verify that the checked-in output exactly matches current definitions:"
msgstr "验证已提交的输出与当前定义完全一致："

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:87
msgid "Validate registry completeness directly:"
msgstr "直接验证注册表完整性："

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:93
msgid ""
"`npm --prefix frontend run build` runs the Node manifest check together with the "
"other research-code and golden-contract verifiers."
msgstr "`npm --prefix frontend run build` 会运行 Node manifest 检查，以及其他研究代码和 golden contract 验证器。"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:96
msgid "Edit policy"
msgstr "编辑策略"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:98
msgid ""
"Do not edit generated files by hand. A manual change can be overwritten on the next "
"generation and can make the frontend, backend, and tests disagree about accepted "
"fields or connections. Review both the source definition and the generated diff when "
"changing a Node contract."
msgstr "不要手动编辑生成文件。手动变更可能在下次生成时被覆盖，并使前端、后端和测试对可接受字段或连接产生分歧。修改 Node 契约时，应同时审查源定义和生成差异。"

#: ../../en/reference/node-contracts.md:103
msgid ""
"For a complete definition workflow, see [Add a scalar Observable](../extend/add-"
"observable.md)."
msgstr "完整的定义工作流请参见[添加标量 Observable](../extend/add-observable.md)。"
